^{99}-1) \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 \\end{pmatrix}.\\]\nThus, the final answer is:\n\\[\\boxed{\\begin{pmatrix} 2^{99} & 0 & 100-1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & (2^{99}-1) \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 \\end{pmatrix}}.\\]",
